# Web UI Rules

- Server-render with Jinja2 templates under `app/web/templates/`. Use HTMX for partial updates (approve/reject/edit, pickers).
- Do not introduce React/Vue/Next or a bundler for the admin/portal UI.
- Auth: GitHub OAuth; pending users until `verified` / `is_admin` (ADR-0006, ADR-0008).
- Portal shows only approved decision states — never expose `proposed` there.
- Keep route modules focused (`auth.py`, `projects.py`, `decisions.py`, `portal.py`, integrations_*).
- Use shared deps from `app/web/deps.py` and templating helpers from `app/web/templating.py`.
- Prefer progressive enhancement: forms should work; HTMX improves UX.
- Add or update tests in `tests/test_web_*.py` / `tests/test_auth.py` for behavior changes.
